Sval: browser_download_spam_protection.js expects each window's own list

downloads-per-workspace has the panel list the downloads of the workspace
its window shows, and a second window shows a workspace of its own, so
the first window's download is not in the second's list. That one check
expects Sval's count, and the rest of the task runs as upstream's.

